stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ungraded: L1 a claim appears with no register row
    Ungraded --> Hypothesis: L2 no primary source - kill criterion and V-item written
    Ungraded --> Open: graded open - the instrument does not exist yet
    Ungraded --> Blocked: graded blocked - the failing tool is recorded
    Ungraded --> Undone: graded undone - scoped capture work not done

    Open --> Verified: L3 instrument notified and captured at the issuing host
    Open --> Hypothesis: L3 instrument notified but not yet read at primary
    Blocked --> Verified: L4 re-capture by a different method succeeds
    Undone --> Verified: L5 each captured jurisdiction becomes its own row

    Hypothesis --> Verified: L6 primary source survives a hostile re-check
    Hypothesis --> Qualified: L6 with a qualifier - mirror, caveat, not in force, negative, posture
    Hypothesis --> Hypothesis: L8 range tightens - the threshold is never moved
    Hypothesis --> Killed: L7 kill criterion fires or a primary source contradicts

    Qualified --> Verified: L9 mirror pulled - L10 provision commences - L12 product executed
    Qualified --> Killed: L11 a law, judgment or designation falsifies a dated negative

    Verified --> Verified: L13 re-verify trigger fires and the source still holds
    Verified --> Stale: L14 re-verify date passes with no re-check
    Stale --> Verified: re-check recorded and the source holds
    Stale --> Killed: re-check finds the claim false
    Verified --> Split: L16 one component found unsupported
    Split --> Hypothesis: the unsupported component is re-graded
    Verified --> Killed: L15 amendment, corrigendum, repeal or event falsifies it
    Verified --> Qualified: L19 an audit of captures finds a non-primary host or a summary read as the instrument

    Killed --> Killed: L17 a re-proposal is refused and logged
    Killed --> [*]: terminal - a returning quantity enters by L1 with a new ID

    note right of Stale
        Planning and customer uses demote.
        Published rule versions keep enforcing.
        A priority re-verify task opens.
    end note

    note right of Killed
        Every conclusion that rested on the
        claim gets a Reversed register row - L18.
        The old rule version is archived, never erased.
    end note
